arth they're introducing the latest  model of the jetta currently the  best-selling vw  it's had a facelift and the grille has  been adapted to improve engine cooling  misha o'horn of volkswagen says his  company has done a good job on the  exterior by freshening up the design  that looks wider and deeper but also  more dynamic and sportier  and inside there are differences too  vw is particularly proud that they've  improved the car safety standards  sell better in the states than in  germany points out sasha volkswagen has  sold more than a million jettas over the  last year it's one of the most  competitive cars in america  volkswagen is big in china too and there  just happens to be an auto show in  beijing as well  it's time for the guys to head over to  asia  new york to beijing is a hell of a drive  so matas and sasha caught a flight  instead  now they're at the auto china 2014 with  a new volkswagen touareg  there's also a new midsize coupe concept  car it should give an idea of what  direction the company will take in the  near future  enjoys a great tradition in china with a  presence there going back more than 25  years the new midsize coupe was designed  by klaus bischoff and his team in  wolfsburg  it could shed some light on how the new  passat cc will look it's a little  broader than the current passat and  shorter than the new jetta with its long  hood and short overhangs it's  reminiscent of the sirocco too  the kids are certainly enjoying getting  to grips with the cars  mata says it's more like a family outing  here than a publicity event but that's  how it is different folks different  strokes  german car makers know how important the  chinese market is it's experiencing  major growth like no other country in  the world  sales figures for suvs are especially  strong  audi has latched on to this they've  introduced a tt off-road concept car  which combines the power of a sports  model with the extra space of an  off-roader  it's also a plug-in hybrid making it  environmentally friendly  says they use intensive filtration  systems to keep dust and dirt out of  their cars and stop them getting inside  in the first place that's particularly  important in a city like beijing with  its serious pollution issues it means  customers get some respite from the smog  when they get into their cars  the hybrid engine delivers 408  horsepower and can reach 100 kilometers  per hour in just 5.2 seconds and it uses  less than 2 liters of fuel over 100  kilometers  porsche had some beauties on show  there were premieres for two new gts  models  the new porsche boxster gts  and the new porsche cayman gtx  the new cars are at the top of their  respective ranges  by default  sales and marketing head bernhard maya  says both cars have greater performance  and torque than before  as well as special chassis and the  porsche active suspension management  system as standard both also come with  extra features  the cayman gts comes with 340 horsepower  and the boxster's stats are similar the  new convertible will go on the market in  germany for under 70 000 euros  both models will be hitting the streets  in may here in china and in the usa  german car makers are showing why their  success is set to continue around the  world  you
 

